
# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scopes: data, comparison, virtuoso, git, ui, runtime, native, klayout,
#         docs, tests, tooling, deps, project
# Imperative English summary; lowercase verb; no final period; aim for <=72 chars.
#
# Explain the problem and resulting behavior after a blank line.
# Record relevant validation and any material limits.
#
# For a breaking public API/format change, add ! before the colon and explain:
# BREAKING CHANGE: <impact and migration>
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md and docs/development/COMMITS.md.
